{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dump[ster] of Fears</u></strong> is a visual novel anthology that tells several very atmospheric mini-stories that are interconnected and complement each other. It's like the arches of one big adventure, which are well perceived separately from each other. All the stories are about ordinary people, although...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292460/extras/f51c8ad36db007073a6b8217091a8be3.avif?t=1770549243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292460/extras_big/f51c8ad36db007073a6b8217091a8be3.avif?t=1770549243 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the first mini-story tells about Nazar and Kateryna, who have to face a number of difficult problems or situations that also need to be solved quickly, as every second brings the death of some characters closer. Whether they will cope or not is the answer in the game itself.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >high-quality sound and voice acting of the characters (recommendation to play with headphones);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >different visual style and genre of mini-stories;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mini stories are full of interesting events and last no more than 2-3 hours.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292460?t=1770549243","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770549243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292460/7e0a101bf29592d0d01c938c11bb8ab4268bbd88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770549243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292460/7e0a101bf29592d0d01c